@1000 = ~Valen: Core NPC~
@1001 = ~Give More Creatures Protection From Level Drain & Undead~
@1002 = ~This version of Valen requires BG2EE or EET.~

// ================================================================
// Legacy ToB-check warning (intentionally preserved — Rule 28)
//
// This string dates from the original pre-EE mod, where it was used
// as a pre-install warning for players without Throne of Bhaal. With
// the REQUIRE_PREDICATE GAME_IS ~bg2ee eet~ guard now in place in
// Component 10, this string can never fire on a supported install.
// It is left in place per Rule 28 (do not "clean up" legacy oddities
// without a concrete reason) rather than removed outright.
// ================================================================
@4001 = ~

** WARNING **

It looks like you do not have BG2: Throne of Bhaal installed. Valen
requires ToB. This installation will probably fail. Go install ToB! 

** WARNING ** 

~